fn gm_decode_word4 ins edit ulong 8192 meta edit ulong 512 wq ulong wd ulong to void
for i ulong 4
if lt i 3
put meta 10 GM_NOREG
put meta 11 shl ulong 1 sub 20 mul 8 i
gm_imadi ins meta get meta add 456 i wq wd
else
gm_shr ins meta get meta add 456 i wq wd 4
end
end
for i ulong 4
gm_andi ins meta get meta add 456 i get meta add 456 i 0 0x07f00000
end
for i ulong 4
gm_andi ins meta get meta add 452 i wq wd shl ulong 0x80 mul 8 i
end
for i ulong 4
put meta 10 get meta add 456 i
if lt i 3
put meta 11 shl ulong 1 sub 24 mul 8 i
else
put meta 11 1
end
gm_imadi ins meta get meta add 452 i get meta add 452 i 0
end
end

fn gm_comp_ffma ins edit ulong 8192 meta edit ulong 512 i ulong to void
for q ulong get meta 509 bound 4
