fn gm_comp_tile sp view ulong 8 ins edit ulong 8192 meta edit ulong 512 to void
for q ulong get meta 509 bound 4
mm = add get meta 508 q
if eq get sp 4 3
mm = rem xor mm 1 get sp 2
